WEBVTT

00:14.070 --> 00:17.010
♪Tear up all the memories of the past♪

00:18.200 --> 00:20.850
♪Let go of all regrets♪

00:20.850 --> 00:26.260
♪I exchange my whole life for a change♪

00:27.730 --> 00:31.280
♪If I decide to let my guard down♪

00:31.830 --> 00:36.120
♪Will I fall for the wrong one♪

00:37.080 --> 00:40.630
♪I dare to give
without fear of destruction♪

00:41.620 --> 00:43.830
♪Love refuses to fall asleep♪

00:43.830 --> 00:46.870
♪I dare to shake heaven and earth♪

00:46.870 --> 00:48.950
♪Even with different paths and goals♪

00:48.950 --> 00:53.010
♪I have no regrets♪

00:53.520 --> 00:58.290
♪Because you're
an unsolvable riddle by fate♪

00:58.290 --> 01:02.580
♪I pray for a miracle♪

01:02.580 --> 01:03.990
♪Over the time♪

01:03.990 --> 01:06.000
♪Even if I'm burned out♪

01:06.000 --> 01:08.850
♪I'm willing to search for the miracle♪

01:08.850 --> 01:12.120
♪Of being with you forever♪

01:12.120 --> 01:16.820
♪I will travel with you all the way♪

01:17.520 --> 01:25.170
♪Love is the most beautiful in life♪

01:37.840 --> 01:43.200
=Sword and Fairy=

01:43.400 --> 01:46.509
=Episode 6=

01:54.800 --> 01:57.550
I thought there were
precious items inside.

01:57.960 --> 01:59.800
It turned out to be just
some ordinary valuables.

02:00.280 --> 02:01.350
Those people from Qiyuan Sect

02:01.350 --> 02:02.560
have looted so many valuables.

02:03.070 --> 02:04.280
There must be a lot of victims.

02:10.800 --> 02:12.350
What is this stone for?

02:12.880 --> 02:13.900
Master Luo.

02:14.350 --> 02:15.120
Heroes.

02:15.430 --> 02:16.000
Heroes?

02:16.590 --> 02:18.070
Is that referring to us?

02:20.070 --> 02:21.750
What is it, everyone?

02:24.640 --> 02:25.550
Heroes.

02:26.070 --> 02:27.910
We'll never forget that you've saved us.

02:28.230 --> 02:29.480
If there's anything I can help with,

02:29.710 --> 02:30.840
I'll spare no effort.

02:32.480 --> 02:34.160
It's okay, please get up.

02:34.390 --> 02:35.800
It is our duty.

02:37.030 --> 02:38.230
So this is what it feels like

02:38.520 --> 02:39.640
to be a hero.

02:40.190 --> 02:41.680
Everyone, are you leaving now?

02:42.120 --> 02:43.070
We've been missing for days.

02:43.190 --> 02:44.640
Our families must be extremely worried.

02:45.160 --> 02:47.510
Since we were saved by you luckily,

02:48.079 --> 02:49.280
it's time for us to go home.

02:51.510 --> 02:54.280
But you all were kidnapped here.

02:54.400 --> 02:56.470
You should have no money left.

02:59.870 --> 03:01.040
We will figure it out on the way.

03:01.190 --> 03:02.870
Even if we have to drink from rivers
and eat wild vegetables,

03:03.000 --> 03:04.230
we will still make it home.

03:12.760 --> 03:14.110
Whatever you say, Zhaoyan.

03:16.640 --> 03:17.230
Everyone,

03:17.470 --> 03:20.000
we found some of the Qiyuan Sect's loot.

03:20.280 --> 03:21.870
Take some as travel expenses.

03:21.960 --> 03:23.440
I'll make up for it later.

03:23.760 --> 03:24.750
Thank you.

03:25.110 --> 03:26.190
Thank you, hero.

03:26.280 --> 03:27.320
Thank you so much, hero.

03:27.510 --> 03:28.190
Let's go.

03:41.829 --> 03:43.040
This pearl is beautiful.

03:44.079 --> 03:45.510
Yu Xiang will definitely like it.

03:50.590 --> 03:51.829
Thank you, heroes.

03:52.030 --> 03:52.600
Thank you.

03:52.720 --> 03:53.190
Many thanks.

03:57.470 --> 03:59.390
Not bad for the Master
of the Luo family, Zhaoyan.

04:00.310 --> 04:02.000
You flatter me, Senior.

04:02.310 --> 04:05.030
It's the first time I've heard
uncle praise people.

04:11.310 --> 04:12.190
Interesting.

04:14.440 --> 04:17.440
Yue Qi is suspected as Lord Ming.

04:18.910 --> 04:22.600
And before it's resolved, we suspect
Bian Luohuan to be the Didact.

04:23.880 --> 04:24.520
Maiming.

04:24.830 --> 04:27.280
Do you think he is
the mastermind of Qiyuan Sect?

04:28.440 --> 04:30.750
Just invite them to the Luo family.

04:31.310 --> 04:33.310
We'll see about it then.

04:35.470 --> 04:35.909
Okay.

04:38.390 --> 04:39.110
Cang Feng.

04:42.390 --> 04:43.159
I have a premonition.

04:44.950 --> 04:48.310
Physician Bian will surprise me.

06:10.950 --> 06:12.200
You had a tough time, right?

06:14.880 --> 06:15.720
Next time,

06:17.000 --> 06:18.350
don't do such foolish things.

06:20.200 --> 06:21.440
Whether it's for me

06:24.630 --> 06:25.280
or for him.

06:40.720 --> 06:41.350
Qi.

06:44.040 --> 06:45.760
I once swore not to use this spell.

06:48.630 --> 06:50.040
But you're severely poisoned.

06:50.830 --> 06:51.790
I have to use it.

06:58.440 --> 07:01.910
♪The deep feelings are hidden
behind the mask♪

07:03.470 --> 07:06.220
♪Only through the eyes♪

07:07.310 --> 07:10.450
♪Who can see them clearly♪

07:12.400 --> 07:18.180
♪I'm destined
to brave all dangers for you♪

07:20.250 --> 07:26.440
♪Even if I cannot escape fate
in the end♪

07:28.400 --> 07:35.830
♪I gave up everything
for a moment of heartfelt resonance♪

07:36.460 --> 07:42.800
♪Leaving love
with an unspoken explanation♪

07:44.360 --> 07:51.500
♪I'm destined
to brave all dangers for you♪

07:54.510 --> 07:55.200
Qi.

08:00.560 --> 08:07.940
♪I gave up everything
for a moment of heartfelt resonance♪

08:09.790 --> 08:10.440
(It's all right now.)

08:13.280 --> 08:15.600
(I may not be able to
protect you for a lifetime,)

08:17.600 --> 08:19.000
(but as long as I am here,)

08:19.950 --> 08:21.230
(I will keep you safe.)

08:23.350 --> 08:25.350
(Even if I receive the chastisement
by the Chastisement Stone,)

08:26.830 --> 08:28.110
(I would not hesitate.)

08:32.490 --> 08:40.270
♪I am madly in love with you
and will do everything for you♪

08:40.460 --> 08:48.330
♪Leaving behind proof of my love♪

08:50.790 --> 08:53.480
I wonder what the Mortal Realm is like.

08:54.830 --> 08:57.040
Is the sky there also blue?

08:57.670 --> 08:59.600
Are the clouds there also white?

09:03.000 --> 09:06.040
How do butterflies there fly?

09:09.880 --> 09:10.670
Master.

09:19.630 --> 09:20.300
How is it?

09:22.830 --> 09:24.670
Take a look at the bottom.

09:30.920 --> 09:31.920
Butterflies.

09:43.400 --> 09:46.700
(Yujie Hub,
Hundred Feet Spring Platform)

09:50.040 --> 09:51.830
Why is the Chastisement Stone lit up?

09:53.440 --> 09:54.670
(Ge Qingfei, Leader of Hengdao Sect)
Did Huan

09:55.390 --> 09:56.950
use the Resonance Spell on Qi?

10:22.160 --> 10:22.830
(Huan.)

10:23.560 --> 10:25.120
(The Chastisement Stone is lit.)

10:25.990 --> 10:26.720
(Are you okay?)

10:29.990 --> 10:30.830
Qingfei.

10:31.870 --> 10:32.720
I'm fine.

10:34.390 --> 10:36.560
Your voice is hoarse,
how can you be fine?

10:37.040 --> 10:39.070
Why did you use
the Resonance Spell on Qi?

10:40.430 --> 10:41.510
Qi was poisoned.

10:42.480 --> 10:44.120
I had to use it to save her.

10:44.830 --> 10:47.240
Huan, have you lost your mind?

10:47.680 --> 10:49.160
Three years ago,

10:49.390 --> 10:50.240
to get the permission

10:50.310 --> 10:52.190
to monitor Qi and Yue Jinzhao,

10:52.310 --> 10:54.350
you swore an oath.

10:54.720 --> 10:57.240
If you violate it,
you will be chastised.

10:58.800 --> 10:59.750
Of course I remember it.

11:01.040 --> 11:02.630
But I am her master.

11:04.430 --> 11:05.830
Even if she doesn't remember me,

11:07.390 --> 11:09.680
I can't just watch her suffer.

11:09.990 --> 11:11.990
When you used the Resonance Spell,

11:12.120 --> 11:13.120
did anyone see you?

11:13.800 --> 11:14.360
No.

11:15.430 --> 11:18.070
Rest assured, I won't expose myself.

11:21.630 --> 11:22.240
Huan,

11:22.990 --> 11:24.720
the matter regarding Qi and Yue Jinzhao

11:25.040 --> 11:25.990
must not be mishandled.

11:27.070 --> 11:27.630
Qingfei.

11:30.280 --> 11:32.040
I know my mission and duty.

11:33.240 --> 11:35.190
I won't affect our plan.

11:36.360 --> 11:37.360
I have a plan

11:38.990 --> 11:41.560
to enter the Luo family

11:42.190 --> 11:43.600
and investigate the relationship

11:44.600 --> 11:45.870
between the Luo family and Rehai.

11:48.280 --> 11:49.830
You found Rehai?

11:50.160 --> 11:50.800
Yes.

12:08.330 --> 12:11.370
(Yujie Hub)

12:12.310 --> 12:13.070
Qingfei.

12:13.390 --> 12:13.990
Yuan.

12:15.630 --> 12:17.800
Qingfei, when will Huan come back?

12:18.430 --> 12:19.190
Be good.

12:19.560 --> 12:20.870
As long as you behave,

12:20.870 --> 12:22.190
he will return soon.

12:23.480 --> 12:24.590
When he comes back,

12:24.590 --> 12:26.920
I'll have him make me another
hundred straw butterflies.

12:27.950 --> 12:29.680
I have something to discuss
with our eldest brother.

12:29.870 --> 12:30.870
Go play by yourself.

12:32.480 --> 12:33.950
You're leaving me alone again.

12:44.510 --> 12:45.160
Brother.

12:46.510 --> 12:48.560
Huan has learned of Rehai's
whereabouts by chance.

12:48.870 --> 12:51.870
He plans to go to the Luo family
in the Western Regions.

12:52.870 --> 12:53.600
Good.

12:54.630 --> 12:55.510
Keep in touch.

12:57.830 --> 12:58.390
Understood.

13:04.720 --> 13:05.640
Anything else?

13:10.680 --> 13:11.510
Take care.

13:33.650 --> 13:36.240
(Ying Xuwei, Leader of the Hengdao Sect)

13:51.870 --> 13:52.970
Judging from her pulse,

13:53.800 --> 13:55.630
the signs of poisoning are gone.

13:58.410 --> 13:59.180
Jinzhao.

13:59.820 --> 14:01.070
Did anything happen just now

14:01.480 --> 14:02.560
in Little Yue's room?

14:06.160 --> 14:07.480
I suddenly felt sleepy

14:07.870 --> 14:08.750
and dozed off.

14:09.190 --> 14:10.720
It seems Jinzhao has also been affected.

14:11.310 --> 14:12.520
If that's the case,

14:12.990 --> 14:14.360
it's not strange

14:14.360 --> 14:16.600
that Bian Luohuan has an antidote
that could save Miss Yue.

14:17.560 --> 14:18.920
What's strange is…

14:19.070 --> 14:20.430
Why the people from Qiyuan Sect

14:21.040 --> 14:22.800
would take the risk of exposure

14:23.600 --> 14:24.510
to save Little Yue?

14:26.800 --> 14:27.630
Could it be that

14:28.430 --> 14:31.120
Physician Bian knew Little Yue?

14:36.800 --> 14:38.950
Did I say something wrong?

14:39.360 --> 14:40.190
You're not wrong.

14:41.920 --> 14:44.480
The people from Qiyuan Sect
referred to Qi as Lord Ming.

14:45.040 --> 14:47.390
Bian Luohuan is suspected to be
the sect leader or the Didact.

14:48.720 --> 14:50.190
Bian Luohuan took the risk to save Qi.

14:50.920 --> 14:52.160
The two of them…

14:53.190 --> 14:53.920
Lord Ming?

14:54.800 --> 14:56.040
It seems that a lot had happened

14:56.920 --> 14:58.190
before we met.

14:59.240 --> 14:59.870
Yeah.

15:01.310 --> 15:02.920
Someone deliberately led us

15:03.360 --> 15:05.160
to the Qiyuan Sect's
stronghold at Fujin Hall.

15:06.190 --> 15:07.510
Qi took the Qiyuan Orb

15:08.830 --> 15:11.070
and was seen as Lord Ming
by the Qiyuan Sect.

15:11.800 --> 15:13.120
We are also baffled by that.

15:15.560 --> 15:16.200
Everyone,

15:17.160 --> 15:19.190
Qi and I have unclear backgrounds

15:20.560 --> 15:22.430
and strange things keep happening.

15:23.210 --> 15:23.880
Over the last three years,

15:24.240 --> 15:25.950
we've been looking for our roots.

15:26.510 --> 15:27.390
If you have any clue,

15:27.720 --> 15:28.600
please be sure to tell us.

15:29.480 --> 15:29.990
Even if

15:31.280 --> 15:32.750
it does relate to the Qiyuan Sect.

15:33.990 --> 15:34.800
Of course.

15:34.990 --> 15:35.870
We are all friends.

15:36.600 --> 15:38.560
Everyone has their secrets.

15:38.800 --> 15:39.750
As long as we have no malice,

15:39.750 --> 15:40.720
we are friends.

15:41.600 --> 15:42.990
Jinzhao, we trust you.

15:43.240 --> 15:45.510
Why not bring Physician Bian
to the Luo family

15:45.720 --> 15:47.020
and see if Maiming can
get anything from him?

15:48.280 --> 15:48.940
That's right.

15:50.070 --> 15:51.600
Bian Luohuan is very likely

15:51.800 --> 15:52.920
to be working for the Qiyuan Sect.

15:53.720 --> 15:55.920
Let's set a trap for him.

15:57.310 --> 15:58.430
I'll go and invite him.

15:59.210 --> 16:00.560
Let's rest here tomorrow

16:00.560 --> 16:01.640
and set off the day after.

16:02.440 --> 16:02.990
Okay.

16:30.280 --> 16:31.180
Physician Bian.

16:32.510 --> 16:33.640
May I come in?

16:34.990 --> 16:35.600
Come in.

16:41.680 --> 16:42.430
Physician Bian.

16:43.310 --> 16:44.310
Thanks to you,

16:44.630 --> 16:46.830
Miss Yue is recovering.

16:47.510 --> 16:49.040
We plan to set off
the day after tomorrow.

16:50.800 --> 16:52.870
We brought you a lot of trouble lately,

16:52.990 --> 16:54.510
so I came to invite you

16:54.630 --> 16:55.680
to be our guest at the Luo Mansion.

16:56.680 --> 16:57.240
It's no trouble.

16:58.390 --> 17:00.280
I haven't been of much help.

17:00.720 --> 17:02.560
I've only done my duty.

17:05.069 --> 17:06.190
It's just a visit.

17:06.480 --> 17:08.240
Please don't decline, Physician Bian.

17:10.920 --> 17:13.680
Then I shall humbly comply.

17:18.310 --> 17:19.069
I'll take my leave now.

17:45.920 --> 17:47.360
Qi, you're awake.

17:48.310 --> 17:48.920
How are you feeling?

17:50.510 --> 17:51.790
I want water.

17:52.120 --> 17:53.160
Okay, here.

18:05.800 --> 18:06.360
So?

18:07.190 --> 18:08.480
How do you feel?

18:14.430 --> 18:15.360
Silly girl.

18:15.870 --> 18:17.750
In the secret chamber, you could've
just dodged that arrow yourself.

18:18.190 --> 18:19.360
Why did you protect Bian Luohuan?

18:22.430 --> 18:23.720
I don't know.

18:24.330 --> 18:25.420
I just felt that

18:26.060 --> 18:28.720
he's someone important

18:29.390 --> 18:30.560
like you.

18:31.390 --> 18:32.990
And I can't let him get hurt.

18:35.430 --> 18:36.920
He's nothing like me.

18:36.920 --> 18:38.560
I am the only one.

18:38.560 --> 18:39.990
You can't compare me to him.

18:40.190 --> 18:40.720
Do you hear me?

18:44.510 --> 18:46.160
Just look at yourself.

18:47.040 --> 18:47.870
He's fine.

18:49.110 --> 18:50.040
But you have to suffer.

18:50.470 --> 18:52.200
If I hadn't saved Physician Bian,

18:52.200 --> 18:53.740
he would've died, right?

18:54.840 --> 18:56.300
I don't understand

18:56.510 --> 18:58.320
why humans fear death,

18:59.160 --> 19:00.470
but you said

19:00.800 --> 19:02.630
life is very precious.

19:02.750 --> 19:03.850
A man has only one life.

19:04.390 --> 19:06.040
Just like Zhaoyan said today,

19:06.680 --> 19:08.470
even the life of an enemy

19:08.470 --> 19:09.840
should not be taken lightly.

19:14.750 --> 19:16.510
You wouldn't have said this before.

19:21.160 --> 19:22.280
You are right.

19:23.960 --> 19:26.750
But Zhaoyan is always right.

19:30.750 --> 19:32.990
Yeah, Zhaoyan is right.

19:33.320 --> 19:35.350
So you don't listen to me, right?

19:41.590 --> 19:42.380
Jinzhao.

19:43.440 --> 19:46.160
I just dreamed about you.

19:46.630 --> 19:47.230
Me?

19:48.160 --> 19:50.040
I dreamed that you gave me

19:50.110 --> 19:51.800
a beautiful butterfly.

19:55.110 --> 19:58.390
I gave you a butterfly?

19:58.960 --> 20:00.960
Yes, in my dream.

20:01.440 --> 20:02.990
I only saw half of your face,

20:03.110 --> 20:04.510
but I still recognized you.

20:04.800 --> 20:06.320
Take a look at the bottom.

20:10.510 --> 20:14.230
(You gave me a glowing
butterfly that can fly.)

20:14.870 --> 20:16.910
(You put it at the bottom
of the food box)

20:16.910 --> 20:17.770
(and waited for me to open it.)

20:44.080 --> 20:47.080
How do you make a butterfly?

20:48.320 --> 20:50.110
This is no work for a man.

20:58.590 --> 21:00.940
Jinzhao, I finally found you.

21:01.270 --> 21:01.670
Look.

21:02.030 --> 21:03.790
This is my latest invention.

21:03.990 --> 21:05.550
This elbow can even move.

21:05.590 --> 21:06.670
Look, it can move when turned.

21:06.670 --> 21:08.910
Shifang, I'm not free today.

21:08.910 --> 21:09.870
I'm thinking.

21:10.270 --> 21:11.190
Show it to me tomorrow.

21:15.350 --> 21:17.030
What are you thinking about?

21:17.390 --> 21:19.350
Tell me, I might be able
to give you some advice.

21:26.990 --> 21:27.630
Here is the thing.

21:28.910 --> 21:29.740
Well,

21:31.150 --> 21:32.240
I have a friend

21:33.070 --> 21:37.390
who may perhaps

21:38.030 --> 21:41.630
possibly

21:42.550 --> 21:43.910
have a girl in his heart.

21:46.550 --> 21:47.390
Do you understand?

21:48.910 --> 21:50.910
I… do.

21:51.350 --> 21:52.950
You're talking about Zhaoyan.

21:53.270 --> 21:53.910
What?

21:55.870 --> 21:56.630
Zhaoyan.

21:58.150 --> 22:01.910
A friend who has a girl in his heart.

22:02.270 --> 22:03.150
That's Zhaoyan, isn't it?

22:03.350 --> 22:04.430
What?

22:06.430 --> 22:06.830
Look.

22:07.590 --> 22:08.720
Your friend

22:09.230 --> 22:10.590
must be one of us.

22:11.270 --> 22:13.190
Who said I only have

22:13.310 --> 22:14.550
just you guys as friends?

22:15.510 --> 22:16.270
Then I can also say

22:16.390 --> 22:19.510
you have Shuo Xuan in your heart.

22:19.790 --> 22:20.950
Nonsense.

22:21.310 --> 22:21.950
I…

22:23.470 --> 22:25.550
Jinzhao, don't talk nonsense.

22:25.550 --> 22:26.430
Right.

22:27.150 --> 22:27.510
Then it's…

22:27.590 --> 22:28.950
Jinzhao, Shifang.

22:29.470 --> 22:30.270
Luo.

22:31.710 --> 22:32.470
Here you are.

22:32.590 --> 22:33.830
Luo, you came at the right time.

22:33.830 --> 22:34.550
We were just talking about you.

22:34.790 --> 22:36.110
What?

22:37.910 --> 22:40.030
We are talking about a girl.

22:40.870 --> 22:43.270
She told my friend

22:43.630 --> 22:45.630
that she dreamed of me… my friend

22:47.150 --> 22:49.630
giving her a butterfly.

22:50.750 --> 22:51.400
Really?

22:52.110 --> 22:53.990
Were we talking about this?

22:56.190 --> 22:58.310
What do you think that means?

22:59.790 --> 23:00.470
I know now.

23:01.470 --> 23:02.590
It means

23:02.910 --> 23:03.820
your friend

23:04.670 --> 23:06.070
is a butterfly.

23:07.350 --> 23:08.070
Nonsense.

23:10.830 --> 23:13.070
I think she might be hinting at you…

23:14.670 --> 23:16.510
your friend

23:16.830 --> 23:17.950
about her expectations.

23:21.910 --> 23:22.590
Expectations?

23:24.230 --> 23:26.430
That's right.

23:28.990 --> 23:31.210
You are truly the master, Luo.

23:31.790 --> 23:32.590
Not only knowledgeable,

23:32.710 --> 23:35.150
but also knows girls well.

23:35.990 --> 23:36.590
Brilliant.

23:37.230 --> 23:37.590
Shifang,

23:38.710 --> 23:40.190
I remember you have a box

23:40.270 --> 23:41.590
that can be opened
through a mechanism.

23:41.950 --> 23:42.390
Is it still there?

23:43.630 --> 23:44.470
You mean

23:44.470 --> 23:46.310
the box that can be remotely
controlled to open.

23:46.430 --> 23:47.790
Right, can I borrow it?

23:49.350 --> 23:50.670
You want to use my gadget?

23:51.350 --> 23:51.990
Can I?

23:51.990 --> 23:53.310
Of course you can.

23:53.710 --> 23:55.430
Jinzhao, I've been dreaming that one day

23:55.670 --> 23:56.550
you'll use my gadget.

23:58.070 --> 23:59.110
Jinzhao, wait here.

23:59.230 --> 24:00.030
I'll go get it.

24:00.110 --> 24:00.630
Okay.

24:00.950 --> 24:01.750
Wait here for me.

24:02.190 --> 24:02.990
I'll wait.

24:05.070 --> 24:06.750
Expectation of me.

24:07.950 --> 24:09.550
You borrow Shifang's gadget

24:09.550 --> 24:11.670
to give Miss Yue a surprise?

24:13.030 --> 24:13.590
How do you know?

24:37.510 --> 24:40.470
Jinzhao, where are you taking me?

24:40.750 --> 24:41.310
Here we are.

24:43.350 --> 24:46.150
Okay, three, two, one.

25:00.470 --> 25:01.640
It's so beautiful!

25:02.190 --> 25:04.390
Jinzhao, how did you find this place?

25:10.030 --> 25:12.670
How did you find it?

25:12.910 --> 25:15.230
I just found it.

25:29.070 --> 25:30.430
Why is there no fragrance?

25:47.190 --> 25:48.200
Butterflies!

25:52.590 --> 25:54.350
Butterflies!

25:54.790 --> 25:57.230
So many butterflies!

26:24.430 --> 26:26.070
Jinzhao, look, butterfly.

26:30.830 --> 26:31.790
You are so bad.

26:31.790 --> 26:33.230
You blew away my butterfly!

27:08.590 --> 27:09.350
Jinzhao.

27:10.030 --> 27:12.350
Isn't that the Polaris you talked about

27:12.430 --> 27:14.110
that can be used for navigation?

27:17.390 --> 27:18.510
It's that one.

27:18.910 --> 27:20.070
You can't even find the right star.

27:20.630 --> 27:22.670
What if you get lost one day?

27:26.350 --> 27:27.430
I have you with me.

27:27.550 --> 27:28.830
You wouldn't abandon me, would you?

27:35.470 --> 27:36.190
(Mr. Yue,)

27:37.150 --> 27:38.310
(is she really your sister?)

27:39.590 --> 27:40.430
(You're not)

27:41.070 --> 27:42.830
(acting like a typical elder brother.)

27:47.910 --> 27:48.430
What are you doing?

27:53.550 --> 27:54.910
Now you can't abandon me.

28:01.030 --> 28:01.670
Qi,

28:03.390 --> 28:04.170
who am I

28:05.270 --> 28:05.910
to you?

28:06.470 --> 28:07.440
You're Jinzhao.

28:08.950 --> 28:10.390
No, I mean,

28:12.110 --> 28:13.670
do you see me as a brother

28:14.670 --> 28:15.950
or someone else?

28:18.870 --> 28:19.980
You're Jinzhao.

28:29.910 --> 28:30.550
What's wrong?

28:31.270 --> 28:31.790
Nothing.

28:34.350 --> 28:36.510
I shouldn't be expecting anything.

28:39.910 --> 28:42.430
But it's good
you don't take me as your brother.

28:48.190 --> 28:49.790
It's a bit cold. Let's go back.

28:50.430 --> 28:50.990
Okay.

29:14.370 --> 29:17.480
♪Looking back♪

29:18.370 --> 29:21.210
♪I try to bring back memories♪

29:22.240 --> 29:26.240
♪We're connected♪

29:26.460 --> 29:28.570
♪It's meant to be♪

29:30.270 --> 29:33.420
♪I've fallen in love silently♪

29:34.490 --> 29:37.470
♪Years leave no trace behind♪

29:38.210 --> 29:40.380
♪On a moonlight night♪

29:40.670 --> 29:41.740
Jinzhao.

29:41.740 --> 29:43.710
It'll take ages if we walk like this.

29:43.830 --> 29:45.670
We'll get there eventually.

29:49.950 --> 29:51.020
I can't walk anymore.

29:53.120 --> 29:54.970
♪The past glided before my mind♪

29:54.970 --> 29:56.950
♪I smiled and cried♪

29:56.950 --> 29:57.870
Is that the truth?

29:59.870 --> 30:00.270
Alright.

30:01.430 --> 30:02.630
You stay here. I'm going.

30:02.630 --> 30:06.170
♪I went about the world looking for you♪

30:06.460 --> 30:10.400
♪All I have was the echo in the valley♪

30:10.400 --> 30:12.410
♪In this tranquil world♪

30:12.410 --> 30:14.400
♪I've finally found you♪

30:14.400 --> 30:18.490
♪I'll spend the rest
of my life with you♪

30:18.490 --> 30:22.270
♪I've been looking for you♪

30:24.070 --> 30:24.990
You win.

30:24.990 --> 30:26.950
You're always the best. I know it.

30:27.260 --> 30:28.770
♪Among the vast sea of people♪

30:28.770 --> 30:30.970
♪I engrave your name♪

30:30.970 --> 30:37.310
♪Believe me, you're the only one♪

30:38.560 --> 30:42.050
♪I went about the world looking for you♪

30:42.700 --> 30:46.290
♪All I have was the echo in the valley♪

30:46.290 --> 30:48.220
♪In this tranquil world♪

30:48.220 --> 30:50.240
♪I've finally found you♪

30:50.240 --> 30:54.370
♪I'll spend the rest
of my life with you♪

30:54.370 --> 30:58.270
♪I've been looking for you♪

30:58.270 --> 31:02.490
♪I wish to share joy
and sorrow with you♪

31:03.070 --> 31:04.770
♪Among the vast sea of people♪

31:04.770 --> 31:06.780
♪I engrave your name♪

31:06.780 --> 31:13.110
♪Believe me, you're the only one♪

31:16.230 --> 31:16.870
I'm coming.

31:19.430 --> 31:21.430
Little Yue, you have recovered well.

31:21.870 --> 31:23.590
Physician Bian is great indeed.

31:24.270 --> 31:25.390
Physician Bian saved me?

31:25.790 --> 31:26.570
Yes.

31:29.550 --> 31:30.110
Jinzhao.

31:31.270 --> 31:31.990
What's wrong with your leg?

31:32.470 --> 31:32.870
I…

31:33.110 --> 31:33.630
He's fine.

31:34.190 --> 31:36.550
He just carried me
for a while last night.

31:36.670 --> 31:38.110
He must be faking.

31:38.190 --> 31:39.830
Last night?

31:40.950 --> 31:42.790
That's very grateful of you.

31:43.150 --> 31:44.110
Of course.

31:44.350 --> 31:45.270
I'm not heavy.

31:45.510 --> 31:47.470
You just carried me for a little while.

31:47.710 --> 31:48.590
How can you be sore?

31:48.710 --> 31:49.950
You're definitely faking.

31:50.070 --> 31:51.150
That's right.

31:58.350 --> 32:00.140
Ming Xiu, save me.

32:02.710 --> 32:04.270
Physician Bian, what brings you here?

32:06.110 --> 32:07.910
Are you coming with us?

32:12.910 --> 32:14.030
Physician Bian,

32:14.030 --> 32:15.790
thank you for saving me last night.

32:16.550 --> 32:17.270
You wake up

32:17.470 --> 32:19.230
because of your
abundant spiritual power.

32:19.830 --> 32:21.830
Moreover, you saved me yesterday.

32:29.590 --> 32:30.790
Now that everyone's here,

32:30.790 --> 32:31.870
let's get going.

32:40.720 --> 32:43.470
(Yunlai Stone)

32:56.310 --> 32:57.470
This stone is magical.

32:57.590 --> 32:58.860
It's like an island.

33:00.070 --> 33:01.230
This is the Yunlai Stone,

33:01.390 --> 33:02.670
a divine stone from ancient times.

33:02.910 --> 33:04.990
It can take you anywhere you wish to go.

33:10.670 --> 33:12.150
Ming Xiu, what is this?

33:19.350 --> 33:21.270
It's used to confirm the destination.

33:29.790 --> 33:31.350
Qi, slow down.

33:48.790 --> 33:49.670
Thank you, Physician Bian.

33:51.350 --> 33:52.950
Thank you for saving my Qi,
Physician Bian.

33:56.630 --> 33:57.790
A jealous one.

34:17.030 --> 34:18.550
I wonder if you two have any plans.

34:18.989 --> 34:19.670
If you don't mind,

34:20.389 --> 34:22.190
please stay for a few more days.

34:23.949 --> 34:24.810
We'd be delighted.

34:26.550 --> 34:27.110
No need.

34:27.790 --> 34:29.310
Since Uncle wants to stay,

34:29.670 --> 34:30.590
I will take my leave first.

34:31.070 --> 34:31.830
Thank you, Master Luo.

34:33.870 --> 34:34.670
Before we set off,

34:35.070 --> 34:36.389
Hanjiang had specified

34:36.750 --> 34:37.790
that you should make more friends.

34:38.909 --> 34:41.510
There's no rush to send the greeting
cards to the Zhengwu Alliance.

34:42.989 --> 34:44.110
If you leave so abruptly,

34:44.870 --> 34:46.190
he will be sad.

34:48.270 --> 34:50.070
I will never befriend those
who harbor demons.

35:05.150 --> 35:06.590
Ming Xiu is leaving?

35:07.080 --> 35:08.350
That's her nature.

35:09.430 --> 35:10.350
Please don't mind her.

35:14.190 --> 35:15.510
Let's go, everyone.

35:22.110 --> 35:22.830
Physician Bian.

35:23.910 --> 35:24.550
After you.

35:35.070 --> 35:36.310
(This time at the Luo Mansion,)

35:37.110 --> 35:38.070
(I wonder if I'll see Luo Wangping)

35:38.590 --> 35:40.510
(who took away my cultivation.)

35:47.270 --> 35:48.030
Surround Bian Luohuan.

35:48.270 --> 35:49.230
Yes!

35:54.150 --> 35:55.510
You have finally

35:56.190 --> 35:57.390
shown your trap.

35:58.110 --> 35:58.990
What's going on?

35:59.270 --> 36:00.670
Isn't Physician Bian coming here

36:00.750 --> 36:02.070
as a guest?

36:02.950 --> 36:03.470
Little Yue.

36:03.950 --> 36:05.990
Physician Bian is very likely
to be related to the Qiyuan Sect.

36:09.110 --> 36:09.710
Physician Bian.

36:10.030 --> 36:11.870
Is that true?

36:12.790 --> 36:13.470
Do you believe in them

36:14.470 --> 36:15.150
or me?

36:20.030 --> 36:21.270
I believe in Jinzhao.

36:27.790 --> 36:28.270
Then

36:28.670 --> 36:30.270
why do you bother asking?

36:32.430 --> 36:32.790
Let's go.

36:38.870 --> 36:40.230
Qi, stop watching.

36:40.670 --> 36:41.990
If it's really related to our origins,

36:42.070 --> 36:43.230
this is the best way.

36:49.310 --> 36:51.430
(It's the first time Qi cares
so much about someone.)

36:52.790 --> 36:53.870
(Who is he?)

